        "left_desktop_image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1000005580_3_1.jpg",
        "left_mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_1000005580_4_1.jpg",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "heading_text": "From one obsessed \npet parent to another",
        "details_text_1": "<p>The moment I adopted my first pet as an adult (we now have 3), I became obsessed. That obsession eventually developed into being a full-fledged crazy pet mom who couldn't stop digging into what was actually in the products I was buying. Hint: things you can’t unsee after you see them.</p><p>So I set off to do things differently and build the brand I couldn’t find. I called my friend Natascha — a veterinarian who stops to pet every animal she sees, no matter where she is – and we built JoyFull to put science first.</p><p>The result: Clean ingredients. Functional benefits. <br/>No compromises.</p>",
        "details_text_2": "<p>The moment I adopted my first pet as an adult (we now have 3), I became obsessed. That obsession eventually developed into being a full-fledged crazy pet mom who couldn't stop digging into what was actually in the products I was buying. Hint: things you can’t unsee after you see them.</p><p>So I set off to do things differently and build the brand I couldn’t find. I called my friend Natascha — a veterinarian who stops to pet every animal she sees, no matter where she is – and we built JoyFull to put science first.</p><p>The result: Clean ingredients. <br/>Functional benefits.  No compromises.</p>",
        "button_text": "Our Story",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections",
        "button_style": "secondary-button"
      }
